==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*deh₃-}}
Derived from {{l|ru|уда́ться}}, and then {{af|ru|у-|дать}}. {{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*dati}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*dṓˀtei}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*dédeh₃ti||to give}}, whence English {{m|en|donate}}, {{m|en|date}} and {{m|en|data}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|уда́ча}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-удача.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|уда́ча}}

# [[good luck]], [[success]] (achievement of one's aim or goal)
#: {{syn|ru|успе́х|везе́ние|;|сча́стье|шанс}}

